#. Description of the plugin
#: nectar-blocks.php
msgid ""
"Step into the future of WordPress with Nectarblocks, where innovation meets "
"seamless design. Unleash the full potential of your website by transforming "
"the core WordPress editor into a dynamic and robust full-site editor."
msgstr ""
"Stap in de toekomst van WordPress met Nectarblocks, waar innovatie en "
"naadloos design samenkomen. Ontgrendel het volledige potentieel van uw "
"website door de standaard WordPress editor te transformeren in een "
"dynamische en krachtige full-site editor."

